{
  "id": 8867220553927,
  "title": "Custom Softball Comforter Set for Girls – Personalized Name & Number",
  "handle": "custom-softball-comforter-set-for-girls-personalized-name-number",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate any softball enthusiast's room with this custom comforter set from Jeminise, designed for comfort and durability. This personalized comforter set, complete with pillowcases, celebrates their passion for the game, making it a perfect addition to any athlete's space or a thoughtful gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name and number, making it a unique item for any softball player or fan.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Smooth Material:</strong> Made from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fade-Resistant Fabric:</strong> Crafted with environmental protection techniques to ensure the fabric holds its dye and resists fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes one comforter and matching pillowcases to complete the look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and dries quickly; for best results, tumble dry low.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sport Theme:</strong> Features a vibrant softball design, ideal for celebrating a love for the sport and adding a relaxing feel to any room.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<th>Bedding Set Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</table>",
